  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「即将消失的蛋孵化」是一款极简且可配置的模组，它允许地上的鸡蛋在即将消失前孵化。为了防止无限生成鸡群，新的生成数量默认限制为 50。物品（包括鸡蛋）会在 6000 个刻（即 5 分钟）后消失。默认情况下，只有当鸡蛋位于干草块上并即将消失时，才会孵化出小鸡。这可以防止已加载区块中的野生鸡群变得过于庞大。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的 RPG 包中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>eggOnlyHatchesWhenOnTopOfHayBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，鸡蛋只有在放置在干草块上方时才会孵化。这可以防止野生鸡群在不知情的情况下扩张。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>eggWillHatchChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果实体限制器未激活，鸡蛋在即将消失前孵化的概率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 50，最小值 0，最大值 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止过多实体孵化。如果周围 'radiusEntityLimiterCheck' 格半径内的鸡数量少于此处定义的数量，即将消失的鸡蛋才会孵化。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>radiusEntityLimiterCheck</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 32，最小值 1，最大值 256</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">'onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan' 检查所围绕的即将消失的鸡蛋的半径。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>newHatchlingIsBaby</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，新孵化的小鸡将是幼崽形态。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>（示例中将消失计时器设置为 1 秒）</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/despawning-eggs-hatch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在众多独立的模组页面中追踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事项，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
